Version 2.0.1 (2026-09-20)
- fixed default size and position

Version 2.0.0 (2026-09-18)
- Full rewrite of the UI using the UI Toolkit - moving and resizing window is now several times faster
- In controller mode window now shows button hints
- Controller bindings now use UI Toolkit to provide easier bindings and keyboard support
- added simplified chinese translation provided by `sangela`

Version 1.4.2 (2026-07-26)
- raised cap for ingredient knowledge threshold to 100
- new, more compact, window layout (PR by sbelmont85)
- fixed second brew of a recipe falsely marking its potions fully known (PR by sbelmont85)

Version 1.4.1 (2026-07-24)
- fixed crash hovering an absent apparatus slot tooltip (PR by sbelmont85)
- added support for Shared Tooltip from ownlyme (Quick Loot or standalone)

Version 1.4 (2026-07-22)
- Several UI improvements from sbelmont85:
    - added tooltips describing each apparatus role
    - hint at the opposite brew mode when all effects neutralize
    - left-aligned effect list ingredient tooltip for easier readability
    - show brew results in the apparatus box instead of engine message
- API:
    - added `callbackEvent` to data of the `TPA_AlchemyRedone_CollectInfo` event - this event (or `TPA_AlchemyRedone_Open` if absent) will be sent to actor with the collected info
    - added `getKnownEffectFlagsForPotion` and `getKnownEffectFlagsForIngredient` that accept record ids

Version 1.3 (2026-07-20)
- fixed faction rank check off by one
- added owned-apparatus setting and regrouped nearby options
- added button to clear all selected ingredients
- added `getActiveApparatus` to API - returns currently active apparatus
- added new `TPA_AlchemyRedone_PotionBrewed` player event sent when new potion is brewed (but before added to inventory)

Version 1.2 (2026-07-18)
- position Alchemy Window in screen center by default
- improved window sizing and positioning
- added option to override text size
- update min window size and effect icon sizes with text size
- added option to allow using apparatus and containers owned by factions if you have high enough rank (enabled by default) - PR by sbelmont85
- sneak to pickup apparatus and tooltip that shows hints about this when looking at apparatus (hint can be disabled in settings) - PR by sbelmont85
- more fixes for errors caused by weird TR Data ingredients

Version 1.1.1 (2026-07-17)
- fixed errors caused by some TR Data ingredients having gaps in effects

Version 1.1 (2026-07-10)
- added option for reworked effect to use base alchemy for knowledge count (on by default)
- show message when trying to activate owned apparatus
- added option to make window more compact
- small UI tweaks

Version 1.0.1 (2026-07-09)
- small tweaks to window layout and resizing

Version 1.0 (2026-07-09)
- Initial release